From: Gerege Systems Development Team <dev@gerege.mn>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 09:32:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] feat(kernel): add module registry with manifests,
 dependency graph and route gate

Modular Platform refactor Phase 1 foundation: kernel/module package
declares the core/business module split (21 builtin manifests), validates
dependency graph (missing deps, cycles, duplicate route prefixes), and
provides a concurrency-safe registry with enable/disable semantics plus a
chi middleware gate that 404s routes of disabled modules.
